b.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is already documented, so it is a meaningless for the matrix (they are exactly the same in the basis).\r\n\r\n- https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node2d.html#class-node2d-property-scale\r\n- https://docs.godotengine.org/ja/4.x/classes/class_node3d.html#class-node3d-property-scale\r\n\r\nThe flipped scale which will be modified is not permanently retained, but will be modified to what it should be such as when the scene is reopened. So I think you should use `WARN_PRINT()` in `set_scale()` with `#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED`, instead of `get_configuration_warnings()`.\r\n\r\nAlso it is more accurate to use a warning such as “detect implicit rotation by flipping scale” rather than “invalid” IMO, and it would be better to redirect users to the Node2D.scale / Node3D.scale documentation rather than to vague explanations within the warning in terminal. Like `\"Detect unholdable negative scale combinations, it can be modified and converted into rotation. See details in Node3D.scale documentation.\"`.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106719#pullrequestreview-2865956702","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106719","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106719#pullrequestreview-2865956702"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106719"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-24T00:49:58Z","commit_id":"4feac4df1dc461ca02915815a3770d6b933ecc80"}]